WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Keep a favourite
Favorites update immediately and survive a fresh page load.

2
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:15.270
Create a named collection
A playlist begins private and explains its purpose.

3
00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:24.140
Add one song or a whole album
Adding the album keeps the existing song once rather than duplicating it.

4
00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:31.640
Give the playlist a cover and share it
Cover upload/removal and visibility are explicit owner controls.

5
00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:42.340
Make the order yours
Move controls change track order, and a removed track stays removed after reload.

6
00:00:42.340 --> 00:00:49.840
Open the collection on mobile
A different user can listen to the public playlist without receiving owner controls.

7
00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:57.340
Delete only a disposable collection
Cancel keeps the collection; confirm deletes only the playlist created for this recording.
